      "updated": 1795000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Both are locked while an agent runs. Edits autosave into a draft version and the running sandbox; a saved version is made on demand or just before the next message.\nThe terminal runs one command at a time and streams its output.",
